cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "RDataScienceCompendium: Reproducible Resampling, Simulation and Model-Evaluation Methods"
abstract: >-
  An R package and research compendium providing tested implementations of
  nonparametric bootstrap confidence intervals, permutation tests,
  standardised effect sizes with exact intervals, a reproducible
  simulation-study framework with Monte Carlo standard errors, and honest
  model evaluation via stratified, grouped and nested cross-validation.
